&lt;li&gt;5 years of experience in full stack development, across front-end experience including Angular, React, JavaScript or TypeScript, HTML, CSS or equivalent and&amp;nbsp; back-end such as C++, Java/Kotlin, Python, or GO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great to have past experience of designing or working on highly configurable and reusable UI systems or platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
